    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d462-a3">

                <pb facs="0832" n="732" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg732"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 1101.—
                    Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Zárate to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 27,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: With reference to my note of the
                    21st instant, and for the information of your excellency, I have the honor to
                    inclose a copy of a communication which under date of yesterday was sent me by
                    the department of finance, and of the decision pronounced by the district judge
                    of Colima acquitting Mr. Frank B. Kemp in the suit prosecuted against him on
                    suspicion of defrauding the public treasury.</p>
                <p>I improve, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JULIO ZÁRATE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
